classDiagram
    %% PawPal+ draft UML (Phase 2). Update in Phase 6 to match the final implementation.

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +int available_minutes
        +dict preferences
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet) None
        +remove_pet(pet_name) None
        +set_available_minutes(minutes) None
        +total_task_load() int
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +str breed
        +int age
        +list~CareTask~ tasks
        +add_task(task) None
        +remove_task(title) None
        +tasks_by_priority() list~CareTask~
        +pending_tasks() list~CareTask~
    }

    class CareTask {
        +str title
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +str category
        +str preferred_time
        +str recurring
        +bool completed
        +priority_score() int
        +mark_complete() None
        +fits_in(remaining_minutes) bool
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +str start_time
        +int available_minutes
        +list scheduled
        +list skipped
        +build_plan() list
        +sort_tasks(tasks) list~CareTask~
        +fits(task, remaining) bool
        +explain() str
        +summary() str
    }

    Owner "1" o-- "0..*" Pet : has
    Pet "1" *-- "0..*" CareTask : needs
    Scheduler --> Owner : plans for
    Scheduler ..> CareTask : schedules
